An inclusion structure on the integers determines a neighbourhood system, and every computable presentation reconstructs its system.

<!-- formalization -->

**Definition (`InclStructure`).** As set out for this part of the library.

*Proof.* By the presentation read off the inclusion relation and the isomorphism with the reconstructed system. ∎

